(text "PRELIMINARY: 3P4W, 127/220 or 220/380 V, 60 Hz.\nVN_SENSE connects to metrology GND: mains-referenced domain.\nDivider 990k / 1k: ratio 1/991; voltage PGA = 1.\nRC nominal corner ~7.24 kHz. Calibrate including ADC loading.\nInput connectors, surge protection and isolation are NOT complete.\nNot approved for direct mains connection.\n3-wire operation requires a separately validated reference strategy." (at 25 140 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c0200000-0000-4000-8000-000000000130"))
